<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Music Theory Cluster Online</title>
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Fredoka:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Nunito:wght@400;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        :root {
            --coral: #FF6B6B;
            --sunshine: #FFD93D;
            --mint: #6BCB77;
            --sky: #4D96FF;
            --lavender: #9B59B6;
            --peach: #FFAB76;
            --bg-gradient: linear-gradient(135deg, #fef9d7 0%, #e8f4fd 50%, #fce4ec 100%);
            --card-shadow: 0 8px 32px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);
            --card-hover-shadow: 0 16px 48px rgba(0,0,0,0.15);
        }

        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        body {
            font-family: 'Nunito', sans-serif;
            background: var(--bg-gradient);
            min-height: 100vh;
            padding: 40px 20px;
            color: #333;
        }

        .user-panel {
            position: fixed;
            top: 20px;
            right: 20px;
            background: white;
            padding: 12px 20px;
            border-radius: 50px;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 12px;
            z-index: 100;
        }

        .user-panel a {
            text-decoration: none;
            color: var(--sky);
            font-weight: 600;
            transition: color 0.2s;
        }

        .user-panel a:hover {
            color: var(--lavender);
        }

        .user-panel span {
            font-weight: 600;
            color: #555;
        }

        .container {
            max-width: 1100px;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }

        .hero {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 40px 20px 60px;
        }

        .hero-badge {
            display: inline-block;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--coral), var(--peach));
            color: white;
            padding: 8px 24px;
            border-radius: 50px;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(255,107,107,0.3);
        }

        .hero h1 {
            font-family: 'Fredoka', sans-serif;
            font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 8vw, 4rem);
            font-weight: 700;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--coral), var(--lavender));
            -webkit-background-clip: text;
            -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
            background-clip: text;
            margin-bottom: 16px;
            letter-spacing: -1px;
        }

        .hero p {
            font-size: 1.2rem;
            color: #666;
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: 0 auto 30px;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        .hero-links {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 20px;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
        }

        .hero-links a {
            color: var(--sky);
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: 600;
            padding: 8px 16px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            transition: background 0.2s;
        }

        .hero-links a:hover {
            background: rgba(77,150,255,0.1);
        }

        .category {
            margin-bottom: 50px;
        }

        .category-title {
            font-family: 'Fredoka', sans-serif;
            font-size: 1.8rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            margin-bottom: 24px;
            padding-left: 10px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 12px;
        }

        .category-title .emoji {
            font-size: 1.5rem;
        }

        .category-title.rhythm { color: var(--coral); }
        .category-title.pitch { color: var(--sky); }
        .category-title.key { color: var(--mint); }
        .category-title.knowledge { color: var(--lavender); }

        .quiz-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(280px, 1fr));
            gap: 20px;
        }

        .quiz-card {
            background: white;
            border-radius: 24px;
            padding: 28px 24px;
            text-decoration: none;
            color: inherit;
            box-shadow: var(--card-shadow);
            transition: all 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1);
            border: 3px solid transparent;
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        .quiz-card::before {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            right: 0;
            height: 6px;
            border-radius: 24px 24px 0 0;
        }

        .quiz-card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-8px) scale(1.02);
            box-shadow: var(--card-hover-shadow);
        }

        .quiz-card.rhythm-card::before { background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--coral), var(--sunshine)); }
        .quiz-card.pitch-card::before { background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--sky), var(--mint)); }
        .quiz-card.key-card::before { background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--mint), var(--lavender)); }
        .quiz-card.knowledge-card::before { background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--lavender), var(--peach)); }

        .quiz-card.rhythm-card:hover { border-color: var(--coral); }
        .quiz-card.pitch-card:hover { border-color: var(--sky); }
        .quiz-card.key-card:hover { border-color: var(--mint); }
        .quiz-card.knowledge-card:hover { border-color: var(--lavender); }

        .quiz-card-icon {
            font-size: 3rem;
            margin-bottom: 16px;
            display: block;
        }

        .quiz-card h3 {
            font-family: 'Fredoka', sans-serif;
            font-size: 1.3rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            color: #2d3748;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
        }

        .quiz-card p {
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            color: #718096;
            line-height: 1.5;
        }

        .decorative-notes {
            position: fixed;
            pointer-events: none;
            z-index: -1;
            opacity: 0.15;
            font-size: 120px;
            line-height: 1;
        }

        .note-1 { top: 10%; left: 5%; transform: rotate(-15deg); }
        .note-2 { top: 30%; right: 8%; transform: rotate(20deg); }
        .note-3 { bottom: 20%; left: 3%; transform: rotate(10deg); }
        .note-4 { bottom: 35%; right: 5%; transform: rotate(-25deg); }

        .footer {
            text-align: center;
            margin-top: 60px;
            padding-top: 30px;
            border-top: 2px dashed #e2e8f0;
        }

        .footer-links {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 30px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        .footer-links a {
            background: white;
            padding: 16px 28px;
            border-radius: 16px;
            text-decoration: none;
            color: #555;
            font-weight: 600;
            box-shadow: var(--card-shadow);
            transition: all 0.2s;
        }

        .footer-links a:hover {
            transform: translateY(-4px);
            box-shadow: var(--card-hover-shadow);
        }

        .footer-links a.support {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #fff9e6, #fff);
            border: 2px solid var(--sunshine);
        }

        .footer-links a.about {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #e6fff9, #fff);
            border: 2px solid var(--mint);
        }

        .copyright {
            color: #999;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            margin-top: 20px;
        }

        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            body {
                padding: 30px 16px 60px;
            }

            .user-panel {
                position: relative;
                top: auto;
                right: auto;
                justify-content: center;
                margin-bottom: 30px;
                flex-wrap: wrap;
            }

            .hero {
                padding: 20px 10px 40px;
            }

            .hero h1 {
                font-size: 2.2rem;
            }

            .hero p {
                font-size: 1rem;
            }

            .quiz-grid {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            }

            .footer-links {
                flex-direction: column;
                align-items: center;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="decorative-notes note-1">♪</div>
    <div class="decorative-notes note-2">♫</div>
    <div class="decorative-notes note-3">♬</div>
    <div class="decorative-notes note-4">♪</div>

    <div class="user-panel">
        <% if (user) { %>
            <span>Hi <%= user.user_name %>! 🎵</span>
            <a href="/chat">🤖 AI Helper</a>
            <a href="/logout">Logout</a>
        <% } else { %>
            <a href="/login">Login</a>
        <% } %>
    </div>

    <div class="container">
        <div class="hero">
            <div class="hero-badge">✨ ABRSM Grade 5 Ready ✨</div>
            <h1>Music Theory Cluster</h1>
            <p>Master music theory through fun quizzes! Practice intervals, scales, keys, rhythms, and more with instant feedback.</p>
            <div class="hero-links">
                <a href="https://github.com/maxchanhi/music-theory-app" target="_blank">📂 Source Code</a>
                <a href="mailto:chakhangc@yahoo.com.hk">✉️ Get an Account</a>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="category">
            <h2 class="category-title rhythm"><span class="emoji">🥁</span> Rhythm</h2>
            <div class="quiz-grid">
                <a href="/grouping_quiz" class="quiz-card rhythm-card">
                    <span class="quiz-card-icon">🎯</span>
                    <h3>Grouping & Beaming</h3>
                    <p>Learn how notes are grouped in different time signatures.</p>
                </a>
                <a href="/compound_simple" class="quiz-card rhythm-card">
                    <span class="quiz-card-icon">🔄</span>
                    <h3>Simple-Compound</h3>
                    <p>Practice switching between simple and compound time.</p>
                </a>
                <a href="/duration_equation" class="quiz-card rhythm-card">
                    <span class="quiz-card-icon">⏱️</span>
                    <h3>Duration Calculation</h3>
                    <p>Calculate how long notes last in a bar.</p>
                </a>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="category">
            <h2 class="category-title pitch"><span class="emoji">🎹</span> Pitch</h2>
            <div class="quiz-grid">
                <a href="/pitch_id" class="quiz-card pitch-card">
                    <span class="quiz-card-icon">🎵</span>
                    <h3>Pitch Identification</h3>
                    <p>Identify notes on different clefs with accidentals.</p>
                </a>
                <a href="/interval" class="quiz-card pitch-card">
                    <span class="quiz-card-icon">📏</span>
                    <h3>Intervals</h3>
                    <p>Find the distance between two notes.</p>
                </a>
                <a href="/chromatic" class="quiz-card pitch-card">
                    <span class="quiz-card-icon">🌈</span>
                    <h3>Chromatic Scale</h3>
                    <p>Practice identifying chromatic scales.</p>
                </a>
                <a href="/transposing" class="quiz-card pitch-card">
                    <span class="quiz-card-icon">↔️</span>
                    <h3>Transposing</h3>
                    <p>Move music to different keys and clefs.</p>
                </a>
                <a href="/same_pitch" class="quiz-card pitch-card">
                    <span class="quiz-card-icon">🎭</span>
                    <h3>Same Pitch, Different Clefs</h3>
                    <p>Find melodies that sound the same on different clefs.</p>
                </a>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="category">
            <h2 class="category-title key"><span class="emoji">🔑</span> Keys</h2>
            <div class="quiz-grid">
                <a href="/melody_key" class="quiz-card key-card">
                    <span class="quiz-card-icon">🎯</span>
                    <h3>Identify the Key</h3>
                    <p>Find the key of a given melody.</p>
                </a>
                <a href="/inversion" class="quiz-card key-card">
                    <span class="quiz-card-icon">🔄</span>
                    <h3>Chord Inversion</h3>
                    <p>Identify root position, 1st and 2nd inversions.</p>
                </a>
                <a href="/clef_minor" class="quiz-card key-card">
                    <span class="quiz-card-icon">🎻</span>
                    <h3>Clef from Minor Scale</h3>
                    <p>Identify the clef and minor key from a score.</p>
                </a>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="category">
            <h2 class="category-title knowledge"><span class="emoji">📚</span> Knowledge</h2>
            <div class="quiz-grid">
                <a href="/instrument_knowledge" class="quiz-card knowledge-card">
                    <span class="quiz-card-icon">🎺</span>
                    <h3>Instruments & Terms</h3>
                    <p>Test your knowledge of instruments and musical terms.</p>
                </a>
            </div>
        </div>

        <footer class="footer">
            <div class="footer-links">
                <a href="/support_me" class="support">☕ Support This Project</a>
                <a href="/about_me" class="about">😄 About the Developer</a>
            </div>
            <p class="copyright">© Chan Chak Hang Max 2026 | Version 2.0.0</p>
        </footer>
    </div>

    <%- include('partials/ai_chat') %>
</body>
</html>